:''For the Cat Unit, see [[Yurinchi (Super Rare Cat)]]. Not to be confused with [[Gekirinchi (Enemy)]].''
'''Yurinchi''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Yurinchi
|image = E 060.png
|appearance = [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 550¢ - 2,172¢
}}

==Enemy==
Another pathetic enemy, extremely low health, damage and range makes this enemy seem like nothing. This enemy serves no threat to any player that comes across it. Use anything to defeat it as it will most likely die in one hit anyway.

==Strategy==
This enemy is only difficult when buffed to immense levels like in [[Competing for the Princess]] or [[Laughter Brings Kicks]]. Otherwise, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and/or [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] along with meatshields should be enough to beat Yurinchi in earlier stages. In later stages, their [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]] [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|variants]] are more preferable. Note that almost anything can work against Yurinchi due to their extremely low range.

